# DrumMania 6th Mix (G*B16 VER. JAA), Konami 2001: first power-on from blank NVRAM, no inputs. The 573 BIOS boots
# the CD (the flash is blank). Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to
# compare with MAME.
game drmn6m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3000 quit
